.nh
.TH "LAGO" "1" "Sep 2026" "Lago CLI" "Lago CLI Manual"

.SH NAME
lago-v2-fees-list - List fees


.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBlago v2 fees list [flags]\fP


.SH DESCRIPTION
Returns a cursor-paginated list ordered by creation time, newest first. Use after or before to navigate. The page and per_page parameters are rejected.
Only product fees are returned. Fees can be listed before they have an invoice. Legacy fees are excluded.
Requires the product catalog to be enabled and fee read permission on the API key.


.SH OPTIONS
\fB--after\fP=""
	Opaque next_cursor from a previous response. Returns the next page. Cannot be combined with before or include_total_count=true. Keep the same filters when paging.

.PP
\fB--all\fP[=false]
	Fetch every page by following next_cursor

.PP
\fB--before\fP=""
	Opaque prev_cursor from a previous response. Returns the previous page in the same list order. Cannot be combined with after or include_total_count=true. Keep the same filters when paging.

.PP
\fB--created-at-from\fP=""
	Inclusive lower bound on the creation time, as an ISO 8601 date or timestamp. A date starts at midnight UTC. Invalid values return 422.

.PP
\fB--created-at-to\fP=""
	Inclusive upper bound on the creation time, as an ISO 8601 date or timestamp. A date includes that whole UTC day. Invalid values return 422.

.PP
\fB--currency\fP=""
	Currency as an ISO 4217 code.

.PP
\fB--event-transaction-id\fP=""
	Event transaction id.

.PP
\fB--external-contract-id\fP=""
	External contract id.

.PP
\fB--external-customer-id\fP=""
	External customer id.

.PP
\fB--failed-at-from\fP=""
	Inclusive lower bound on failed at. A date starts at midnight UTC.

.PP
\fB--failed-at-to\fP=""
	Inclusive upper bound on failed at. A date-only upper bound includes the whole UTC day.

.PP
\fB-h\fP, \fB--help\fP[=false]
	help for list

.PP
\fB--include-total-count\fP=""
	Requests the total number of matching records. Supported only on the first page, without after or before. The count can be estimated; total_count_estimated is then present and true.

.PP
\fB--lago-invoice-id\fP=""
	Lago invoice id.

.PP
\fB--limit\fP=""
	Maximum number of records per page. Values outside the supported range return 400.

.PP
\fB--payment-status\fP=""
	Payment status.; one of: pending, succeeded, failed, refunded

.PP
\fB--product-code\fP=""
	Product code.

.PP
\fB--rate-card-code\fP=""
	Rate card code.

.PP
\fB--refunded-at-from\fP=""
	Inclusive lower bound on refunded at. A date starts at midnight UTC.

.PP
\fB--refunded-at-to\fP=""
	Inclusive upper bound on refunded at. A date-only upper bound includes the whole UTC day.

.PP
\fB--succeeded-at-from\fP=""
	Inclusive lower bound on succeeded at. A date starts at midnight UTC.

.PP
\fB--succeeded-at-to\fP=""
	Inclusive upper bound on succeeded at. A date-only upper bound includes the whole UTC day.

.PP
\fB--watch\fP[=false]
	Poll and re-render when the response changes

.PP
\fB--watch-interval\fP=2s
	Polling interval used with --watch


